cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Detect, isolate, recover: rotor-fault tolerance for a 5-inch quadrotor (simulation study)"
abstract: >-
  Simulation study and open-source code for rotor loss-of-effectiveness detection,
  isolation and fault-tolerant control of a 5-inch FPV-class quadrotor, including a
  yaw-relaxed controller for the complete loss of one rotor.
authors:
  - family-names: Kronbi
    given-names: Rami
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-08
license: MIT
keywords:
  - quadrotor
  - fault detection and isolation
  - fault-tolerant control
  - rotor failure
  - UAV
